  "content": "\n\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Craftify-Mod/Assets/main/Header%20Card.png\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<center>\n <h2>Craftify 是一款專為 Minecraft 設計的模組，讓你能夠連接音樂服務，並在遊戲內顯示與控制它們。</h2>\n</center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aWRoBp4.png\">\n<center>\n <h3>自 1.6.0 版本起，1.18+ 版本已不再使用 Essential</h3>\n</center>\n<center>\n <h3>Fabric 版本需安裝 Fabric API 與 Fabric Language Kotlin</h3>\n</center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<blockquote>\n <h1>功能特色</h1>\n <h4>💻 歌曲顯示</h4>\n <h4>🎨 主題</h4>\n <h4>📚 主題庫</h4>\n <h4>🔔 歌曲通知／訊息</h4>\n <h4>🔊 完整控制面板介面</h4>\n</blockquote><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<blockquote>\n <h1>支援服務</h1>\n <h4>🟢 Spotify</h4>\n <h4>🍎 Apple Music (via Cider.sh)</h4>\n <h4>📺 YouTube (via YTMD)</h4>\n <h4>👽 Foobar &amp; DeaDBeeF (via beefweb)</h4>\n <h4>🌊 Tidal (via Tidal-HiFi)</h4>\n</blockquote><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<center>\n <h3>💻 歌曲顯示與控制面板🔊</h3>\n</center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/s569O65.png\">\n<center>\n <p>Pixelated 主題由 Mo2men 設計</p>\n</center><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\">\n<blockquote>\n <h1>致謝</h1>\n <h3>💻 開發者：ThatGravyBoat</h3>\n <h3>🎨 裝飾圖示：Twemoji</h3>\n <h3>⛔ 缺失歌曲圖示：Twemoji</h3>\n <h3>💿 圖示與頁面美術：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/vindocel/projects\">VindoCel</a></h3>\n</blockquote><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MvH7yqg.png\"> <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/gravy\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Craftify-Mod/Assets/main/BisectHosting%20Card.png\"> </a>",
